[10016]={"Defeat Orcs and goblins at Rung-shakam (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Raise a banner of the Haban’akkâ of Thráin at Rung-shakam","Raid on Rung-shakam","The Haban'akkâ of Thráin will be victorious!","Destroy Orkish drums at Rung-shakam (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You have done much to hinder the Orcs and their vile allies at Rung-shakam.\
\
You should raise a banner of the Haban'akkâ of Thráin at Rung-shakam.","Defeat trolls at Rung-shakam (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Upon the slopes of Zirakzigil at Rung-shakam, the trolls and goblins of Moria work together to rain great stones upon the Haban'akkâ of Thráin at Azanulbizar.","Orcs, goblins, trolls, and Orkish drums can be found at Rung-shakam.\
\
King Thráin has commanded you to join in the assault at Rung-shakam. You should aid the Haban'akkâ of Thráin.","'The Haban'akkâ has need of your aid, my friend.\
\
'I have received word that our enemies at Rung-shakam again seek to rain boulders on our warriors from above the East-gate. I have no doubt more Orcs with capable enough hands have begun to sound the war-drums once more, but they and their crude instruments must be silenced!\
\
'Let our enemies at Rung-shakam know the wrath of the Haban'akkâ!'","Defeated Orcs and goblins at Rung-shakam (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated trolls at Rung-shakam (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[10017]={"'I am forever at your service, ${PLAYER}.'","Zaudru has made her lair in the caverns beneath the old dwarf-city of Helegrod, in the Misty Mountains. Atli Spider-bane is in the town of Archet, in Bree-land.\
\
Atli Spider-bane has told you the story of his encounter with Zaudru long years ago and has charged you with carrying out his vengeance.","Raid: A New Queen for Deepest Helegrod","'The city of Helegrod has stood empty for long years, ${PLAYER}, but if wretched Zaudru has chosen as her lair the caverns beneath it, it will not remain so for long. Corcur, Angmarim, giant, or drake will not be able to stand against her, though each of them may believe Zaudru to be an ally. When her brood has grown to sufficient size, she will come forth, and woe to any who stand before her! Helegrod will have a new queen!\
\
'Long years ago, I beheld Zaudru in all her bloated majesty, and it is a sight that will never fully leave my mind. My father and brothers and I had begun mining a decent vein when all about there came a great shaking. Rocks fell from above, and dust filled the air. We ran for the surface, but she was upon us before we had gone fifteen paces. The sound of her evil voice still fills me with dread, though I could not make out many of the words she spoke, save one: \\qZaudru\\q she said, over and over, \\qZaudru!\\q I stumbled into the sunlight, and as I turned back to the entrance of the mine, I saw her great, bloated mass moving through the dust, saw the glint of her small and angry eyes. Then the roof gave way and the entrance collapsed, sealing Zaudru behind a wall of stone. It was all that saved me from her.\
\
'Of a dozen dwarves, only I and two of my brothers escaped her clutches that day. I swore vengeance upon Zaudru and took to hunting any of her kind that crossed my path. She must have followed secret paths through the stone, mile after mile, until she came at last to Helegrod. End her, ${PLAYER}. End her and bring me her crimson mandible. She had only one, but it will be the proof of my vengeance.'","Atli Spider-bane has, at long last, learned the location of his greatest foe, the cause of his deep hatred for the foul creatures.","Bring Zaudru's crimson mandible to Atli Spider-bane","Collected Zaudru's crimson mandible","'My father and brothers smile upon you, my friend, for Zaudru is no more.'","'I have no words, ${PLAYER}. That Zaudru no longer lives brings me such joy as I cannot relate to you.\
\
'I am forever at your service and your family's. Walk with honour, my friend, for you have slain Zaudru, most wretched of the spiders that creep beneath the mountains.'","'Zaudru is still alive, ${PLAYER}, and many good dwarves are dead. Journey to the caverns beneath Helegrod and make things right. I charge you with carrying out my vengeance.'"},
[10018]={"'All who remember the story of mighty Durin and fierce Thorog know of Helegrod, ${PLAYER}, but I did not think to hear its name spoken aloud in my time. Though dwarves repaired the gates and tried to reclaim it after the passage of the dragon, it was not meant to be, and my father and his father before him assumed Helegrod would always stand empty.\
\
'But word now comes to my ears of weaving beneath the city, weaving and the clicking of many legs. The Shadow-brood spiders that infest the caverns beneath Helegrod might stay there for years...any spider-hunter knows that the creatures prefer the darkness beneath the mountains to the light of the sun. But if the wretched creature that birthed these monstrosities turns her eyes towards the exit of her cave, towards the snow-covered slopes of the Misty Mountains....\
\
'We cannot let this happen, ${PLAYER}. Despite the danger, you must descend into the caverns beneath Helegrod and defeat as many of the Shadow-brood as you can. Bring to me their venom, for the venom of one brood is often poisonous to others, and I might be able to make use of it against other of the vile creatures. Only mature spiders are likely to have the potent venom I require, and even then, it will be difficult to slay the spiders that carry it without spilling it.'","Collect Helegrod Shadow-brood Venom (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Raid: An Evil Place, Crawling With Spiders","Collected Helegrod Shadow-brood Venom (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Shadow-brood spiders in the caverns beneath Helegrod possess the venom Atli Spider-bane is seeking. Atli is in the town of Archet, in Bree-land.\
\
Atli Spider-bane has asked you to collect venom from the Shadow-brood of Helegrod."},
[10020]={"'Esta próxima tarea no podrás lograrla solo, ni siquiera con una comunidad de tus aliados más cercanos. No, deberás reunir una partida de guerra si quieres derrotar a Bogbereth.\
\
'No es una criatura ordinaria, Bogbereth, la Reina del Veneno de Himbar. Debes atacar rápido y con precisión, pues su piel es como una armadura de acero y sus colmillos son dagas afiladas que gotean veneno.\
\
'Reúne a tu grupo de héroes y regresa a Torech-i-Bogbereth. La encontrarás allí, a menos que ella te encuentre primero.'","Lunathron te habló de una gran y vil araña, Bogbereth, que caza en Himbar.","'¿Has matado alguna araña últimamente, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}?'","'¿Ya has reunido tu grupo de guerra? Bogbereth no caerá sin luchar, y a pesar de tu valentía, no eres una amenaza para ella por ti ${PLAYERNAME:solo[m]|sola[f]}.'","'¿La gran bestia ha caído? Entonces su reinado venenoso ha terminado. Esto ha sido otro golpe para la Corona de Hierro y las fuerzas de Angmar, y todo te lo debemos a ti y a tus aliados.'","Incursión: Bogbereth","'¡Ah, ${PLAYERNAME:el matador[m]|la matadora[f]} de Bogbereth! ¡Bien hecho, de verdad!'","Gath Forthnír está en la parte oriental de Himbar, al sur y al este de Torech-i-Bogbereth.\
\
Lunathron te pidió destruir a la gran araña, Bogbereth. Ahora que ya no existe, puedes regresar para reclamar tu victoria.","'¡El Daño de Bogbereth! ¡Has ganado grandes elogios!'","Bogbereth caza en el extremo noreste de Himbar, al oeste y luego al norte de Gath Forthnír.\
\
Lunathron te advirtió que no enfrentes a Bogbereth con menos que una partida de guerra completamente armada. Debe ser derrotada, o seguirá engendrando su vil prole."},
[10022]={"Captain-General Harvestgain, a târk, leads the forces within Lugazag.\
\
Soldier Súmtharb made it clear that the only objective is to strike down the enemy's leader.","Captain-General Harvestgain is the leader of the Free Peoples at Lugazag.","Raid: Captain-General Harvestgain","Defeat Captain-General Harvestgain and claim Lugazag. You must not be defeated when the Captain-General falls.","'You best be back to tell me you've followed your orders, sluggard! Else I'll throttle you and put you on a cart bound for the muck beneath Mordirith's throne!\
\
'Get out there and slaughter the Captain-General at Lugazag!'","'${RACE}! Your brethren failed us. Lugazag, our tower here in the west, has fallen to the hands of a târk! We must make our way to the tower and slaughter the forces standing watch.\
\
'Do this, and I might think more of you than a maggot, ripe for smashing. Fail me, and I will see you posted to the slave pits of Carn Dûm!'","Angmar claims Lugazag!"},
[10029]={"Worms and drakes have come to live within the central keep of Helegrod, the ancient dwarf-city in the Misty Mountains. Ormulf Worm-hunter is in Othrikar, in the North Downs.\
\
Ormulf Worm-hunter has tasked you with retrieving fangs from the drakes and worms that nest within the central keep of Helegrod. He has refused to offer you a reward for this expedition, insisting that the honour of the deed will be reward enough.","Collected Cruel Helegrod Fang (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Raid: Fangs for Nothing","'If countless drakes and worms now nest within the central keep of Helegrod, it seems the evil history of that place will be continued! It is an insult to the memory of Durin, slain in battle with great Thorog at the gates so many years ago!\
\
'This cannot stand, ${PLAYER}. Journey to Helegrod and defeat the worms and drakes within the keep. I charge you with bringing to me their fangs!\
\
'I have no reward for this task. The honour and sense of duty you possess must serve as reward enough! Do you answer my challenge? Then go to Helegrod, the ancient dwarf-city in the Misty Mountains, and retrieve the fangs of the evil creatures that now lurk within its central keep!'","Collect Cruel Helegrod Fang (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[10031]={"'Storvâgûn seized control of the cliffs above the old dwarf-city, and with riches from robed Men, he bought the loyalty of many giants!\
\
'Some giants that were my friends, but no more! They are traitors now, slaves to the robed Men who pay Storvâgûn. They do not deserve to be called giants!\
\
'If you have brave friends, go to the old dwarf-city and take away the riches Storvâgûn bribed the giants with! Giants record wealth on notched barter-sticks... take them away! Giants sold their loyalty to Storvâgûn and the robed Men... they do not deserve to keep them! I will burn the sticks when you bring them.'","Collected Helegrod barter-sticks (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect Helegrod barter-sticks (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Giants in the service of Storvâgûn and his new masters can be found on the cliffs above Helegrod. Arifael is on Amon Nendir, south-west of Rivendell.\
\
Arifael has asked you to take the notched barter-sticks on which the giants recorded the wealth paid to them by robed Men of Angmar away from them. When you bring him enough of the barter-sticks, he will burn them.","Raid: Giants in Service of Angmar"},
[10032]={"Raid: Grounding Golloval","Taskmaster Bárzqhosh awaits your return within the Isendeep Mine.\
\
Golloval found his end at your will. You should return to Taskmaster Bárzqhosh with the news.","'Do not fail, or this mine will fall into the hands of the enemy, and you will suffer in the slave-pits of Carn Dûm.'","'A threat such as this will not last. I have word that even as he fell and you left him to rot, that the eagle-lord took to the sky again.\
\
'He will return, but we have earned a reprieve by your will!'","Golloval can be found south of the mine in an eagle-eyrie.\
\
Taskmaster Bárzqhosh tasked you with finding and slaughtering the eagle, Golloval.","Return to Taskmaster Bárzqhosh at the Isendeep Mine","'Goblins will aid us in this place, and this is good. Mining is for such lowly races.\
\
'It is the place of warriors, like you, to seize moments and become great! We are vulnerable -- I fear assault at the hands of the eagles who are not far from here.\
\
'The greatest among them, Golloval, is a lord of the sky, and it falls to you and others to bring him at last to the ground!'","Taskmaster Bárzqhosh wants you to ensure that the threat posed by the eagles and their leader, Golloval, are diminshed. He has ordered you to gather a great number and assail the eagle-lord at his eyrie in Arador's End."},
[10033]={"Antiguamente sede del Rey Brujo de Angmar, la temible ciudadela de Gwathrenost proyecta una larga sombra sobre la ciudad de Carn Dûm. Casi abandonada tras la deposición del Senescal de Angmar, los restos de la Corona de Hierro han salido de las sombras, buscando dominar un artefacto perdido del Rey Brujo y reclamar el dominio de Angmar.","Completa 'Gwathrenost, la Ciudadela del Rey Brujo'","Asalto: Gwathrenost, la Ciudadela del Rey Brujo (Semanal)","Grúmach se encuentra en Bail Avarc, en Angmar.\
\
Has vencido a los maestros de la Corona de Hierro en Gwathrenost y finalmente has liberado Angmar de su influencia. Deberías hablar con Grúmach.\
\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Bail Avarc solo se puede acceder inicialmente a través de las rutas de los maestros de establos. Bail Avarc se puede alcanzar a través de los maestros de establos en Esteldín, Gath Forthnír y los establos de Rivendel.</rgb>","Habla con Grúmach en Bail Avarc","'Nos has hecho un gran favor, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Con la batalla contra la Corona de Hierro ganada, espero que nunca más tengamos que temer su regreso. Ninguno de los habitantes de Angmar olvidará tus hazañas!'","Debes superar los males reunidos en Gwathrenost, la Ciudadela del Rey Brujo.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Debes completar 'Gwathrenost, la Ciudadela del Rey Brujo' en cualquier nivel de dificultad para avanzar en esta misión. Una vez que hayas completado 'Descubrimiento: Carn Dûm' viajando a Bail Avarc, utiliza el Buscador de Instancias para unirte a 'Gwathrenost, la Ciudadela del Rey Brujo'.</rgb>","'¡Salve, !\
\
'Debemos actuar contra la Corona de Hierro antes de que sea demasiado tarde. Si queremos poner fin a sus planes para Angmar, no tenemos más opción que atacar el corazón de Gwathrenost.\
\
'Deberías reunir a tus aliados más poderosos, mi ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}. Una vez que estés ${PLAYERNAME:preparado[m]|preparada[f]}, ¡asedia la antigua ciudadela del Rey Brujo!'\
\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Para avanzar en esta misión, debes completar 'Gwathrenost, la Ciudadela del Rey Brujo' en cualquier nivel de dificultad. Una vez que hayas completado 'Descubrimiento: Carn Dûm' viajando a Bail Avarc, usa el Buscador de Instancias para unirte a 'Gwathrenost, la Ciudadela del Rey Brujo'.</rgb>"},
[10034]={"'The ice-drakes surely fear you now! You have done very well, ${PLAYER}!'","'The inner keep of Helegrod is the perfect spawning ground for ice-drakes.'","'So it seems the inner keep of Helegrod, an ancient dwarf-city in the Misty Mountains, is home to worms and drakes beyond count? It makes sense, though I had never thought about it before now!\
\
'The keep there is the perfect spawning ground for the creatures, you see. Inside the central keep, newly-laid eggs will be protected from the cold winds of the mountains and can be tended by the drakes without fear of interference by snowbeasts or other creatures. I have never been to Helegrod, for it has stood empty since dwarves were unable to hold it even after the passing of Thorog, but I know what it must be like from many stories. Balconies on either side of the main halls, with short stairs climbing to different levels? Large rooms in the centre, with plenty of space for the great creatures to move about? The perfect spawning ground!\
\
'If I could leave Othrikar, I would deal with the ice-hatchlings myself, but I gave my word I would stay. If you, however, will journey to Helegrod and defeat any of the newly-hatched creatures within the keep, honour will be yours!'","Raid: Keep Them from Hatching","The central keep of Helegrod is a spawning ground for ice-hatchlings.\
\
Ormulf Worm-hunter has asked you to defeat the ice-hatchlings that are spawning within Helegrod's central keep."},
[10035]={"Bring Mírdanant to Gonediad","Raid: Reclaiming Eregion's Gift","'You have done the impossible, ${PLAYER}. Allow me the honour of examining Mírdanant. I never believed this hour would come, the axe of Durin returned from out of the darkness.'","Gonediad of Rivendell is worried that Thorog will not long stay behind the walls of Helegrod.","The dragon Thorog has been spotted behind the walls of Helegrod, Mírdanant still buried within his neck.\
\
Gonediad of Rivendell has asked you to try and recover the axe of Durin, lost in ancient battle with Thorog at Helegrod.","'If you dare to face mighty Thorog and bring Mírdanant from out of the darkness, some good might yet come from Helegrod again inhabited, though it seem impossible.'","'If the rumour of Thorog's return is true, I fear that the old terrors will seize the people of Eriador. The dragon will not long stay behind the walls of Helegrod.\
\
'And yet this forgotten terror may bring with it hope unlooked-for: Mírdanant, the axe of Durin, is said to remain still buried within the dragon's neck. If Thorog is defeated, the axe might yet be recovered. The fortunes of the dwarves may change for the better once Mírdanant is retrieved, and the words out of Eregion, as well as the friendship of the Gwaith-i-Mírdain with Durin's Folk, might still be proven true.\
\
'I dare not hope that you and your allies could stand triumphant over the might of Thorog that was, for that hope is fleeting. And yet, if you are able to retrieve Mírdanant from the body of ancient Thorog, I know of one unhappy and untrusting dwarf, at least, who might be comforted by its return.'"},
[10036]={"'The forces of evil cannot stand against the true-hearted.'","'Seek within Helegrod for the servants of Angmar, ${PLAYER}. If they are defeated, the evils within that ancient city may give in to their natures and fight among themselves.'","Raid: Servants of Angmar","Lord Elrond has alerted you to the presence of three servants of Angmar in Helegrod.","Grisgart, Adhargal, and Breosal keep the forces of evil under control behind the walls of Helegrod.\
\
Lord Elrond has charged you with defeating the three Angmarim apparently keeping the evils within Helegrod under control and organized.","'The picture becomes clearer to me, ${PLAYER}, and I begin to understand what is happening behind the walls of Helegrod.\
\
'Many evils have come to the dwarf-city: spiders, giants, drakes, the dragon Thorog himself... but undirected, each of these would be likely to fight with the others. The evil power that has come again to Angmar would not condone such in-fighting.\
\
'The Iron Crown must have sent trusted servants out of Angmar and into the mountains, I guessed, to keep the evils within Helegrod mindful and under control. My guess has been rewarded, ${PLAYER}: scouts have reported the presence of three powerful Angmarim within the walls. Their names are known to me from the descriptions of my scouts: fierce Adhargal, cruel Grisgart, and unyielding Breosal. They must be defeated, ${PLAYER}, for perhaps then the uneasy alliance within Helegrod will fall apart, and the problem resolve itself.'","Adhargal has been defeated by Storvâgûn","Defeated Grisgart","'Angmar cannot hold Helegrod. The city will not long stand against us.'","Defeat Grisgart","Habla con Elrond en la Última Morada","'You have done well to defeat the servants of Angmar behind the walls of Helegrod, ${PLAYER}. That Adhargal and Breosal were slain not by you or your allies, but by the forces of evil they sought to control, tells us much of the enemy we face.\
\
'I thank you again, ${PLAYER}. The mountains are safer for your efforts.'","Defeat Adhargal","Defeat Breosal","Breosal has been defeated by Zaudru","Master Elrond is in the library of Rivendell.\
\
The three servants of Angmar within Helegrod have been defeated. Elrond should be told of your success."},
[10038]={"Arifael has told you the tale of Storvâgûn, the new leader of the giants above Helegrod.","Raid: Storvâgûn the Traitor","'The giants left the dwarf-city alone for a long time, not interested in the empty halls. But Storvâgûn wants leadership, and he says the city belongs to the giants just as the mountains do!\
\
'Robed Men spoke with Storvâgûn, and suddenly he has riches! He pledges loyalty to his new friends, offers them the service of all giants -- all giants, not just himself! When others complain and challenge Storvâgûn, he gives them new wealth! Now many giants have joined Storvâgûn above the old dwarf-city.\
\
'He is no giant. He is a traitor to his people! If you are brave beyond your tiny stature, bring many friends and take Storvâgûn's emblem of loyalty to the robed Men away from him. He only has one. Look for him on cliffs above the old dwarf-city in mountains. I think his new friends mistake Storvâgûn's loyalty. He will betray them too, perhaps! But he betrayed giants first, and he must pay for it.'","Bring Storvâgûn's emblem of loyalty to Arifael","'Storvâgûn betrayed the giants, and now he regrets it!'","The giant Storvâgûn is on the cliffs above Helegrod, the ancient dwarf-city in the Misty Mountains. Arifael is on Amon Nendir, south-west of Rivendell.\
\
Arifael has asked you to take Storvâgûn's emblem of loyalty away from him. Robed Men of Angmar gave the emblem to him in exchange for the service of the giants.","'Storvâgûn is a traitor to the giants, but he is also very strong. If you go to old dwarf-city in mountains to take his emblem of loyalty from him, be careful. He will betray the robed Men too, I think, but I will not forgive him for betraying the giants first. He forgot he is a giant when he was given riches!'","'The old dwarf-city in the mountains is no place for giants. Too small.'","Collected Storvâgûn's emblem of loyalty","'Storvâgûn is no more? You have the thanks of Arifael, tiny ${RACE}! There is no amount of wealth that will make Arifael forget his true loyalty: to giants, not to robed Men!\
\
'You are strong indeed, and Storvâgûn now knows it! Robed Men know too, and quake in fear, I think!'"},
[10039]={"Bring Helegrod Corcur talismans to Elladan","Elladan has long fought the Corcur of the Trollshaws and the Misty Mountains, and fears their new allegiance to Angmar.","'My brother and I have long fought the Corcur, ${PLAYER}, and the news that they have given their allegiance to Angmar and now hold the dwarf-city of Helegrod between their forces are unhappy tidings. They must be driven forth.\
\
'The Corcur carry talismans from which they believe their strength and power comes... we must recover these talismans from the Corcur of Helegrod. They are fierce warriors, but they put such stock in these talismans that their will is broken when they are deprived of them.\
\
'Bring me the talismans from the Corcur of Helegrod, and I will destroy them. Perhaps we can stem this tide before they are ready to sweep down from the mountains in battle!'","Raid: The Corcur of Helegrod","'You do not have the talismans of the Corcur of Helegrod, ${PLAYER}? Why is this so?'","'I do not fear the Corcur.'","'You have done well, ${PLAYER}, and you have my thanks for this brave deed! I have fought the Corcur, and their ferocity is known to me. Without these talismans, their people will be demoralized. Perhaps they will no longer be the allies that Angmar hoped to have!'","Collected Helegrod Corcur talisman (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'My father will stand always against the evil that has come to Helegrod.'","The Corcur of Helegrod can be found within its walls, far north of Imladris in the Misty Mountains. Elladan is at Thorenhad, his camp among the Bruinen Gorges west of Rivendell.\
\
Elladan has told you that each of the Corcur within Helegrod carry talismans from which they believe their strength comes. If enough of these talismans can be taken from their grasp, the will of the Corcur may be broken."},
[10040]={"'We must reclaim Mount Gundabad and that means putting an end to Hrímil Frost-heart!\
\
'If you aid Prince Durin and the Dwarves of the Gabil'akkâ in their efforts at the Hiddenhoard of Abnankâra and succeed, we will offer you a fine reward!'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: You must complete 'The Hiddenhoard of Abnankâra' on any difficulty Tier to advance this quest. Once you have completed 'Discovery: The Hiddenhoard of Abnankâra', use the Instance Finder to join 'The Hiddenhoard of Abnankâra'.</rgb>","You have completed 'The Hiddenhoard of Abnankâra'!","The Hiddenhoard of Abnankâra can be found in the Clovengap in Mount Gundabad.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: You must complete 'The Hiddenhoard of Abnankâra' on any difficulty Tier to advance this quest. Once you have completed 'Discovery: The Hiddenhoard of Abnankâra', use the Instance Finder to join 'The Hiddenhoard of Abnankâra'.</rgb>","You have completed 'The Hiddenhoard of Abnankâra'.","Complete 'The Hiddenhoard of Abnankâra'","Zóva, advisor to Prince Ingór, has requested your aid in the continued efforts to reclaim Mount Gundabad.","Raid: The Hiddenhoard of Abnankâra (Weekly)","Your deeds at Abnankâra have proven instrumental in the reclamation of Mount Gundabad.","Completado"},
[10041]={"'Elladan has told me of the Corcur in Helegrod, ${PLAYER}, and that they have likely sworn fealty to Angmar. This union can bring nothing but hardship to the people of the mountains and to my people in Imladris.\
\
'We must combat the Angmarim before they can prepare their full strength. Helegrod was a city of riches before the dragon came, and even after Thorog was laid low, the dwarves could not reclaim it. I do not doubt that its deepest vaults still contain weapons and devices that might be turned to the service of evil.\
\
'The Angmarim of Helegrod surely carry the signs of their servitude: emblems twisted into evil shape by foul craft. Bring these emblems to me and I will rid the world of them. We will strike a blow against Angmar and its latest fastness by depriving its people of their tokens.'","Collected Helegrod Angmarim Emblem (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Elrohir is troubled by the presence of Angmarim in Helegrod, the old dwarf-city in the mountains north of Rivendell.","Bring Helegrod Angmarim emblems to Elrohir","'You have done well this day, ${PLAYER}, and Angmar should now fear your name and the names of your allies!\
\
'I will destroy these foul emblems. They set an uneasiness upon my mind, and I am loathe to bear them any longer. I cannot imagine how it must feel to always wear one of these, and proudly, but the Men of Angmar are fallen to darkness and their ways are not our own.\
\
'I thank you again, my friend.'","'The Men of Angmar who bear emblems of that land are wholly twisted and evil.'","Raid: The Long Reach of Angmar","'Perhaps one day, Helegrod will stand empty again.'","Angmarim inside Helegrod, the old dwarf-city in the Misty Mountains, bear emblems that reveal their loyalties. Elrohir is at Thorenhad, his camp among the Bruinen Gorges west of Rivendell.\
\
Elrohir has asked you to defeat Angmarim inside Helegrod and take from them the emblems they carry.","'The Angmarim of Helegrod carry at all times emblems that reveal their loyalties. Take these emblems from as many Angmarim as you find behind the walls, and we will send to them the message that they are not welcome!'"},
[10042]={"'Has detenido la malvada máquina del Caldero de la Muerte, has frenado el suministro de dinero a las Quebradas del Norte, y has puesto fin al terror de Deluches, ¡pero aun así los Muertos se alzan! Temo que esto sea obra del temido hechicero, el señor Ferndúr. Has reunido aliados y nos has ayudado a frenar la propagación de los Muertos. Sin embargo, derrotar a Ferndúr no es tarea pequeña. Si deseas desafiar a este funesto maestro de la muerte, debes reunir una fuerza aún mayor.\
\
'Creo que Ferndúr está más preocupado por la invocación de los espíritus malignos que se usan para animar los cuerpos tambaleantes de los muertos, que por los propios tumularios. Debes regresar a la isla maldita en Imlad Balchorth, encontrar el lugar donde los espíritus malignos se agolpan y destruirlos. Destrúyelos a todos, y quizá Ferndúr aparezca, pues debe saber cuando sus espíritus invocados son desterrados.\
\
'Ten cuidado, pues esta amenaza puede ser la más grave hasta ahora, enfrentada en la oscuridad de Angmar, un mal monstruoso cuyo único superior en el Norte se encuentra en la temida ciudadela de Carn Dûm misma.'","'Realmente has realizado una hazaña digna de los grandes relatos de épocas pasadas. Puede que pase mucho tiempo antes de que Imlad Balchorth sea purificado de su antigua maldad, pero con un solo golpe has quebrado uno de los principales pilares que sostienen la vil fuerza de Angmar.\
\
'Te saludo.'","Incursión: El Amo de Imlad Balchorth","Has encontrado la guarida de Ferndúr","Eiláf está de regreso en Myrkworth, al este de la guarida de Ferndúr.\
\
Con Ferndúr muerto, debes regresar con Eiláf para contarle la historia de tus hazañas.","Eiláf cree que el hechicero Ferndúr se ocupa de los espíritus malignos que habitan en el área no muy lejos del Caldero de la Muerte.","'¡El asesino de Ferndúr! ¡Honraré tu nombre entre los Pueblos Libres!'","'¡Encuentra a los espíritus malignos, y eventualmente encontrarás a su maestro!'","Haz salir y derrota a Ferndúr","Hay espíritus malignos en una zona en ruinas no muy lejos del Caldero de la Muerte, en la isla central de Imlad Balchorth.\
\
Ferndúr debe ser destruido para dispersar la amenaza maligna en esta tierra maldita."},
[10043]={"The Roving Threats Quartermaster of Central Gondor asks you to band together and vanquish the Roving Threats of Central Gondor.","'This is a dire situation. The Hardened enemies of Central Gondor have banded together to stand off against those who oppose them. Many have fought these Roving Threats alone but together their strength is unequalled. Call upon your allies to vanquish this assemblance of evil before we are all in danger.'","The Hardened enemies of Central Gondor have banded together to stand off against those who oppose them.","'You have done a great deed to all on Central Gondor. You shall be remembered by many Gondorians from this day forward.'","Speak to the Roving Threats Quartermaster of Central Gondor","Incursión: Las amenazas errantes de Gondor Central","'Now is the time to fight!'","The Roving Threats Quartermaster of Central Gondor can be found in Central Gondor.\
\
You should speak with the Roving Threats Quartermaster of Central Gondor."},
[10045]={"Raid: Thorog Defeated","'I know not how it has happened, ${PLAYER}, but Thorog has been returned to life through some foul craft! Sigrun and I have seen him, with our own eyes, perched atop the walls of Helegrod like an evil memory given hateful shape.\
\
'So long as the beast lives, the honour of the dwarves is tarnished; both Durin and Mírdanant are lost and cannot rid us of this scourge.\
\
'I do not know if you have allies to rival Durin's great company of old, but it will take many stout hearts to best evil Thorog. If he can be drawn from his perch atop Helegrod, you must do what you can to defeat him, or all the lands will be threatened.'","The dragon Thorog has been seen atop the walls of Helegrod, in the Misty Mountains.\
\
Greip and Sigrun have seen Thorog from their small camp north of the source of the Bruinen and have charged you with his defeat."},
[10046]={"A powerful Orc warrior, the Tyrant Barashish has taken command of Tirith Rhaw. Sergeant-at-Arms Hesten has enlisted your talents in removing the Orc from the tower.","The Free People reclaim Tirith Rhaw!","Raid: Tyrant Barashish","'You did well, ${PLAYER}. We need to continue our efforts in driving these Orcs from the Ettenmoors. Take this and know that you are well-thanked for your efforts.\
\
'Seek out Quartermaster Ash in Glân Vraig to retrieve your greatest rewards.'","Speak with Sergeant Hesten","'The Orcs proved strong enough to overwhelm our forces in Tirith Rhaw. Now, a fell foe has taken control of the tower. We must muster our forces and drive them from that place at once.\
\
'Gather a force together and make your way north into the Coldfells. Tirith Rhaw stand overlooking the valley to the west. You must enter and defeat the master of the Ongbûrz at this location.\
\
'Seek out the Tyrant Barashish at Tirith Rhaw and defeat him. Fight with honour and return the tower to our control.'","Sergeant-at-Arms Hesten awaits your return at Glân Vraig.\
\
You defeated the Tyrant Barashish to reclaim Tirith Rhaw, You should return to Sergeant-at-Arms Hesten with the news.","'We must retake Tirith Rhaw. Make your way to the tower, north of this location, in the centre of the Coldfells. Defeat the Tyrant Barashish, then return to me.'","The Tyrant Barashish is at Tirith Rhaw, north of Glân Vraig, in the centre of the Coldfells.\
\
Sergeant-at-Arms Hesten at Glân Vraig directed you to seek out and defeat the Orc Tyrant, Barashish who holds command at Tirith Rhaw.","Defeat Tyrant Barashish and reclaim Tirith Rhaw. You must not be defeated when the Tyrant falls."},
[10049]={"Defeat Tyrant Gundzor and claim the Grimwood Lumber-yard. You must not be defeated when the Tyrant falls.","The Free Peoples claim the Grimwood Lumber-yard","'There's been a terrible turn in the Grimwood over in Hithlad, ${CLASS}. A troll moved in and swept clean the people that were watching over the area.\
\
'We received orders to recruit folk willing to make the journey west into Hithlad in search of the Grimwood Lumber-yard to face down and defeat the Tyrant Gundzor. If you are willing, make your way west in search of the beast and strike him down. Then return to me when you're done.\
\
'Don't try to be too much of a hero, ${CLASS}. You'll not face a foe like that on your own, nor with a company of friends. Take a lot more to defeat a terrible foe like Gundzor.'","'Better news has not blessed these ears in many days, my friend. You proved a mighty warrior and asset to the Free Peoples here, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'I shall not forget what you have done!'","Raid: Tyrant Gundzor","Sergeant-at-Arms Hafthor awaits news of your victory over the Tyrant Gundzor at Glân Vraig.\
\
You met the Tyrant Gundzor within the lumber-yard and defeated him and his forces, taking the yard back for the Free Peoples. You should return to Sergeant-at-Arms Hafthor with the news.","Within the depths of the Grimwood there is a grove where the trees have been cleared and a small lumber-camp built. The grove has fallen to the Ongbûrz and must be reclaimed.","The Grimwood Lumber-yard lay near the centre of Hithlad.\
\
Sergeant-at-Arms Hafthor asked you to find and defeat the troll-tyrant Gundzor at the Grimwood Lumber-yard.","'Take the beast down quickly so we can move back into the wood and have a better spot to strike at the enemy from.\
\
'I'm rambling too much...get out there and defeat that troll!'"},
[10051]={"'You have scored a great victory for the Free Peoples, ${PLAYER}. We honour your accomplishment and duty, but also warn that we cannot relent in our battle against the Enemy.\
\
'If we do not remain resolute, the Enemy will drive south and swallow this land in war.'","Tol Ascarnen, once the citadel responsible for the manufacture and storage of Rhudauran weapons and armour, lay to the north and west of Glân Vraig.\
\
Sergeant-at-Arms Thurimbent directed you to kill Tyrant Trintrû at Tol Ascarnen.","Raid: Tyrant Trintrû","'You will find the Tyrant in the upper reaches of Tol Ascarnen. Make your way there and defeat him. Only then can Captain-General Mákan retake Tol Ascarnen and secure this most important location.'","'Captain-General Mákan wishes to retake Tol Ascarnen, and we are enlisting all who are able to take the fight to the Hoardale and defeat the Uruk in charge of the Ongbûrz war-host.\
\
'North and west of Glân Vraig lay the Hoardale and on an island in the centre of the river is Tol Ascarnen. Make your way there and defeat the Tyrant and his war-host. \
\
'Return to me when you have done this. Do not be fool-headed, this is not a mission for one or a handful. You will need a great many to best this foe.'","Speak with Sergeant-at-Arms Thurimbent at Glân Vraig","Tol Ascarnen has fallen to the Enemy. You have been tasked by Sergeant-at-Arms Thurimbent at Glân Vraig to find and defeat Tyrant Trintrû within the walls of Tol Ascarnen.","Sergeant-at-Arms Thurimbent awaits your return at Glâin Vraig.\
\
Facing down the enemy, you destroyed the Tyrant at Tol Ascarnen. You should return to Sergeant-at-Arms Thurimbent with the news.","Defeat Tyrant Trintrû and reclaim Tol Ascarnen. You must not be defeated when the Tyrant falls.","The Free People reclaim Tol Ascarnen!"},
[10052]={"The caverns beneath Helegrod are riddled with cracks and crevices, home to Zaudru's hatchlings.\
\
Atli Spider-bane has asked you to slay as many Shadow-brood hatchlings as you can find beneath Helegrod.","'If the caverns beneath Helegrod are now home to wretched Zaudru, as it seems they must be, every day that passes must see the increase of her spawn. The hatchlings of Zaudru possess an unusually ravenous appetite, even for spiders, and will feast on anything that stumbles near. They have need of great amounts of flesh and blood if they are to grow to adult size.\
\
'We must stop them before they do, ${PLAYER}, for Zaudru gives to her brood the strength and toughness that she herself possesses. Much easier to slay them as hatchlings, I tell you truly!\
\
'The caverns beneath Helegrod are almost certainly riddled with cracks and crevices within which Zaudru's Shadow-brood hatchlings vie for dominance. Approach these holes and slay as many of the creatures as emerge into the light.'","Raid: Zaudru's Brood"},
[10053]={"'You're not dead. Couldn't be your skill. Fortune must follow you closer than most.'","Defeat raiding Corsairs in their camp (${NUMBER}/10)","Collect Jerath's cutlass","Return to Elder Roshat in Khûtra","Elder Roshat asks that you deal with raiders west of Khûtra in order to prove worthy of a greater task.","Defeated raiding Corsairs (${NUMBER}/10)","'It seems you are not entirely without worth,' Elder Roshat says.\
\
'The stench is not our only problem. We have been raided multiple times by Corsairs camped south of here. Their leader, Jerath, was cast out of Khûtra for petty thievery. He has borne a grudge ever since, descending from the hills and harrying our people.\
\
'These raiders always attack from the west. Find their camp and wipe them out. From the look of you, I doubt you'd survive a brush with them, but if you did deal with these raiders, perhaps you'd prove worthy of a larger task.\
\
'Bring Jerath's cutlass back to me as proof of his demise.'","Defeat Jerath in the raider camp and retrieve his cutlass. Then return to Elder Roshat in Khûtra.","Elder Roshat asks that you deal with Jerath and his raiders. Their camp can be found along the road west of Khûtra.","'Those raiders still need to be dealt with, and quickly.'","Raiders From the West","Jerath's cutlass acquired"},
[10056]={"Habla con Adleithian","Un saqueador de tumbas intenta detenerte","Saqueadores de Barad Tharsír","Adleithian le preocupa que los saqueadores de tumbas hayan tomado el control de las ruinas de Barad Tharsír, en el Barandalf.","'Barad Tharsír está al sureste de este Coloso, en el Barandalf, al otro lado del río Brandivino.'","Barad Tharsír se encuentra al sureste del Coloso, en el Barandalf, al otro lado del Brandivino.\
\
Adleithian  te ha pedido que encuentres una habitación oculta en las ruinas de Barad Tharsír y descubras qué hay dentro. Si algo te molesta, debe ser eliminado.","Investiga las ruinas","'Ahora sé lo que buscan. Hay una habitación en algún lugar dentro de las ruinas de Barad Tharsír donde cualquier objeto que no estuviera documentado en el registro de mercancías de un barco era confiscado hasta que se pudiera probar su propiedad. Aunque la mayoría de esos objetos probablemente se han perdido para siempre, todavía podría haber una gran cantidad de pequeñas baratijas y joyas escondidas dentro.\
\
'La habitación se encuentra en el lado sur de las ruinas. Según los informes, la puerta es igual a las demás y la habitación no está tan dentro del complejo. Me sorprende que haya durado tanto tiempo sin ser descubierta, pero como dije antes, nosotros mismos pensábamos que Barad Tharsír estaba completamente vacío y saqueado. Claramente estábamos equivocados.\
\
'Regresar a las ruinas en la playa y encuentra esta habitación. Busca dentro y regresa con lo que encuentres. Si alguien o algo te molesta mientras estás allí, acaba con ellos. Barad Tharsír debe ser devuelta a nosotros.'","'La promesa de un tesoro saca a relucir lo peor de los hombres.'","'Barad Tharsír es más seguro gracias a tus esfuerzos.'","Adleithian está en el campamento de Montaraces en el Coloso, al noroeste del Barandalf y al oeste de Parth Aduial.\
\
Adleithian está esperando escuchar lo que has encontrado en la sala de objetos confiscados.","Saqueador de tumbas derrotado","'¿Así que su líder intentó emboscarte? Parece que todo esto era solo una treta. Los saqueadores se han vuelto más astutos en sus intentos de emboscarnos. Aunque no lo suficiente como para vencerte. Un día, con el resto de Evendim, Barad Tharsír verá su gloria restablecida.'"},
[10057]={"Habla con el Maestro Buencorazón al sureste de las Ruinas de la Guardia del Sur","'¡Buen trabajo, mi muy capaz ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}! ¡Esos asaltantes bandidos seguramente deben estar arrepintiéndose de su elección de ocupación ahora, yo diría!\
\
'Aquí está tu recompensa, como prometí. Continuaré hacia el norte tan pronto como pueda, pero por ahora tengo algunos preparativos más que hacer. ¿Quizás nos encontremos de nuevo?'","Asaltantes en el Camino Verde","Asaltantes bandidos causan problemas en el Camino Verde donde pasa hacia las Tierras de Bree.","Maestro Buencorazón está al sudeste de las Ruinas de Guardia del Sur.","'¡Eh, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}! ¿Te diriges hacia el norte? Oh, quizás quieras reconsiderarlo. Hay bandidos a lo largo de todo el Camino Verde, ¡e incluso acampan en las ruinas entre aquí y las Tierras de Bree! Las Ruinas de Guardia del Sur, sí, están llenas de bandidos, ¡y se vuelven aún más peligrosos cuanto más al norte vayas!\
\
'¿Quién soy yo? Mi nombre es Buencorazón. Maestro Buencorazón, para mis amigos, y espero que demuestres ser uno de ellos. Verás, solo soy un mercader, y si voy a dirigirme al norte hacia Bree, ¡tendría que pasar junto a esos rufianes! Bueno, en mis días más jóvenes quizás podría haber hecho algo con esos villanos, pero tristemente mis días de blandir la espada probablemente quedaron atrás.\
\
'¡Pero tú eres ${PLAYERNAME:un aventurero[m]|una aventurera[f]}! No, no intentes negarlo: tienes el aspecto de ${PLAYERNAME:uno[m]|una[f]}. Si puedes derrotar a algunos de estos asaltantes del Camino Verde, podría ver conveniente desprenderme de algunas de mis monedas. Solo necesito que te enfrentes a los bandidos que están aquí en el camino, así que no hay necesidad de que pases a las Ruinas de Guardia del Sur; son los villanos del camino los que son el problema. ¿Qué dices?'","Asaltantes bandidos derrotados en el Camino Verde (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Si puedes derrotar a algunos de estos asaltantes del Camino Verde, podría ver conveniente desprenderme de algunas de mis monedas. Solo necesito que te enfrentes a los bandidos que están aquí en el camino, así que no hay necesidad de que pases a las Ruinas de Guardia del Sur; son los villanos del camino los que son el problema. ¿Qué dices?'","Maestro Buencorazón, ciudadano preocupado, quiere que hagas algo con respecto a los asaltantes en el Camino Verde.","Derrota asaltantes bandidos en el Camino Verde (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[10058]={"'I should not be impressed since you have done all that we have asked, but I am. You do as we ask without thought or question.\
\
'The Abominations are a sad tale, indeed. They also kill without thought or question but for all the wrong reasons. We watch them, but we are wary of destroying them all because it is not in our nature.\
\
'Now, I may have information regarding the Dunlending strangers you are seeking.'","Defeated Abomination Orcs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat Abomination Orcs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Raiders to the North","The Elders of Lhan Rhos spoke of terrible creatures that they call the Abominations.","Talk to Anurin in the Dunbog","Anurin is on the northern lines of the Avanc-lûth.\
\
Elder Déin instructed you to speak with Anurin once you have defeated the waves of Abomination Orcs.","'Please, stop the next assault from the Abominations. We can not afford to lose our village.\
\
'The creatures attack from the north.'","'We have much to talk about, Duvodiad. Here in the Dunbog we are able to stay out of the affairs of the rest of Dunland. We know that storms brew on the horizon, but we make certain that we keep out of the rain.\
\
'Part of the reason is that we have a constant reminder to the north of what happens when we do not mind our own affairs. The last time that we interfered, Saruman took many of our people and did foul things to them. I am not sure what he was doing there, but he returned one day with an army of twisted monsters, abominations to nature.\
\
'Now we need to deal with the attacks of the Abominations every day. Go north and help stave off the attacks of these creatures, and when you are done, speak with Anurin.'","The Abominations attack Lhan Rhos from the north.\
\
Elder Déin has asked you to stop the Abomination invasions."},
[10059]={"'Ah, the good stuff! This is much better than the usual slop we Uruk-hai get here.'","Raiding the Larder","'Morflak is good to his friends. Just don't cross him, and you'll be fine. Keep it up, ${RACE}!'","The largest larder is within the guard-house, atop a short stair within the southernmost point of the ring-wall, right by the entrance to Isengard.\
\
Morflak's lackey wants you to get some of the good food from the guard-house and to bring it to Morflak, north-west of the southern entrance and south-west of Orthanc.","'This is much better than the slop we usually get! Those who serve Morflak well are always rewarded! You did very well, little ${RACE}.'","'There are larders in the buildings that line the Ring, and that's where the good food is kept. The largest one is within the guard-house, right by the entrance at the southern-most point of the ring. A set of steps lead to the door. You've seen the slop they feed us here. The good stuff is saved for the guards at the gate!\
\
'Well, Morflak wants some of the good stuff, and if you get it for him, he's bound to share some of it with the ones he can trust. That's me, and if you do this well, maybe it's you too.\
\
'So go to the larder and grab some of the good food -- don't let the gate-keepers see you with it -- and bring it back to Morflak!'","Find the guard-house by the southern gate and pick up some good food","Talk to Morflak","Morflak's lackey is very pleased about your delivery of the food to Morflak.","Morflak's lackey has told you that the best food is saved for the guards at the gate, but Morflak wants some of it.","Delivered the food to Morflak","You have delivered the food to Morflak and should speak with him.","Talk to Morflak's lackey"},
[10063]={"Raised Notices","With the Dale-lands as lively as ever, Captain Álarr has asked you to aid him in posting more guards' notices and orders from the Master throughout Lake-town.","Collect the stack of notices in the guards' barracks","You have gathered the notices, and should now begin posting them","Talk to Álarr","Posted notices in Lake-town (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Back again, are you? I have orders from the Master and a bunch of notices that need posting... and soon!\
\
'What do you say, ${PLAYER}?'","Captain Álarr can be found in the Guards' Barracks in Lake-town.\
\
You should return to Álarr and inform him that the notices are posted.","The stack of notices is in the guards' barracks in Lake-town.\
\
You should collect the stack of notices.","Post notices in Lake-town (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Yes, yes, I trust that you posted them. You'll be wanting this, I presume?'","Notices can be posted in places all around Lake-town.\
\
You should post notices around Lake-town."},
[10064]={"You have slapped two cow rumps, but there are yet more rumps that need slapping.\
\
You should slap more cow rumps at Ritherstad, in northern Pinnath Gelin.","The threat of goblins would be enough to make most folk seek safety until the dangerous creatures could be beaten back into their mountain holes. That is not the case for all residents of Pinnath Gelin, however.","She swishes her tail irritably at you, but runs off","'Ahaha! You did it! I saw my girls running for the hills. They'll be safer out there for now, and I will remove myself to Ost Arndír to ask for more help. You have my thanks.'","Nordach has sent you on to Ritherstad in search of Varbris.\
\
Ritherstad is in northern Pinnath Gelin.","'Igerna came through here a few days ago and hasn't returned. She headed off to Ritherstad, even though I tried to warn her that it's been overrun by goblins! Can you believe it? This used to be a quiet place to live.\
\
'I can see in your eyes that you're determined to follow after her. Like Igerna, you seem capable, but, well, I thought she was also and she has yet to return. Good luck, then! Keep your eyes open for Varbris. That fool also refuses to fall back to some place safe and is probably lurking around his farm getting into trouble with the goblins.'","'Who are you? Have you come to help? Ah, Igerna? Yes, she came through here. She's since moved on to try to find the source of the goblins, leaving me here to defend my farm on my own! Well, truth be told, she directed me to flee to Ost Arndír, but I shan't let my home be overrun!\
\
'What do you say? Will you help me deal a blow to these scum?'\
\
When you agree, Varbris' shoulders slump with relief.\
\
'You have no idea how relieved I am to hear that! Now here's my plan: these goblins are here for my cows! I love these daft girls dearly, but they are far too unworried about our new guests. Go into the fields and give 'em a right good smack right on the rump! They'll run off a ways to safety.'","After a very judgemental side eye, she trots away","Slap Brúlen's rump","Slap Glúsi's rump","You have slapped one cow rump, but there are yet more rumps that need slapping.\
\
You should slap more cow rumps at Ritherstad, in northern Pinnath Gelin.","Return to Varbris","Slap Alo's rump","She ponders biting you, but then hustles away","Talk to Varbris","Slap Griga's rump","Your hand stings and you have stepped in something squishy and yet - there remain still more rumps that need slapping!\
\
You should slap more cow rumps at Ritherstad, in northern Pinnath Gelin.","Raising a Rumpus","You have slapped enough cow rumps to consider it a new profession of yours, but one rump yet remains unslapped!\
\
You should slap one more cow rump at Ritherstad, in northern Pinnath Gelin.","Brúlen huffs in surprise and gallops off","You have successfully driven off the cows of Ritherstad. You should let Varbris know his beloved girls are safe from goblins for the moment.\
\
Varbris is at Ritherstad.","Varbris has asked you to slap the rumps of his cows and shoo them away from the farm so that they might not fall prey to the goblins.\
\
You should slap cow rumps at Ritherstad, in northern Pinnath Gelin.","With a stomp of her hooves, she charges off","Slap Elester's rump"},
[10065]={"Tents constructed (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Raising the Tents","Return to Sângal in Iridír and let him know you have finished setting up the tents for the displaced people to use. They no longer have to sleep in the open weather and cold.","Gather tent supplies (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Sângal is worried that the displaced people in Iridír have no place to sleep. You can gather supplies nearby to help construct the tents.","'Ah, adventurer. I could use your help!\
\
'We have people arriving here in Iridír who have been driven from their homes by the assaults in Ambarûl. I worry for them having to sleep wherever they can find room and being exposed to the weather and cold. I have some supplies here. Would you please take them and set up some tents that they can stay in?'","Construct tents (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Return to Sângal","Help Sângal set up tents for the displaced people in Iridír.","'The tents will work flawlessly! Well done! Thank you, ${CLASS}! I will inform the people of your efforts and let them know they will no longer be forced to suffer the outdoors.'","Tent supplies gathered (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Sângal is worried that the displaced people in Iridír have no place to sleep. He has asked that you help construct tents to be used as temporary shelters."},
[10066]={"El Viejo Artemisa cree que si los huargos se enfadan, enviarán a su líder.","Huargos derrotados en Nain Enidh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Pronto tendremos más viajeros en la posada, ¡estoy seguro!'","'Odio a los huargos. ¡Me alegra que hayas enviado mi mensaje a los huargos de Nain Enidh!'","Derrota huargos en Nain Enidh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Habla con el Viejo Artemisa","El Viejo Artemisa está en el campamento en el extremo este de Minas Eriol.\
\
Los huargos seguramente están enfadados ahora, dados tus logros en Nain Enidh, y el Viejo Artemisa debe ser informado de tu éxito.","Se pueden encontrar huargos en el Gran Camino del Este, en el extremo de Nain Enidh, cerca de Ost Cyrn.\
\
El Viejo Artemisa cree que si enfadas a suficientes huargos, llamarán a su líder.","'Va a tomar un tiempo antes de que la comida especial que estoy preparando esté lista. ¿Qué deberías hacer mientras tanto?\
\
¡Ah, ya sé! Los huargos son bestias de mal carácter, y son más inteligentes que un lobo común... también más fuertes. Eso significa que pueden enfadarse, y si pueden enfadarse, pueden cometer errores.\
\
¡Estoy seguro de que esa lógica funciona! Ahora escucha bien: ¡ve al este! Ve al extremo de Nain Enidh y busca huargos en las tierras salvajes cerca de la carretera de Ost Cyrn; derrota a todos los que encuentres. ¡Enfádalos bien, y su líder seguro que aparecerá, hambriento de carne!'","'¿Así que derrotaste a muchos huargos? ¡Tienes talento para esto, eso es seguro!\
\
Creo que también terminé de cocinar. Tal vez no del todo, pero estoy seguro de que esto atraerá a su líder, o líderes, y entonces...\
\
Entonces los derrotarás y harás la carretera segura para los viajeros, eso es, ¡y tendremos más huéspedes en la posada!'","Provocando la ira de los huargos","'Ve a Nain Enidh, al este, y mata huargos. ¡Haz que se enfaden! No queremos que deambulen por el Gran Camino del Este. ¡Enviemos ese mensaje a su líder!'"},
[10068]={"La Ciudad de los Trasgos está al noreste del campamento de Glóin, y la sala del trono debería hallarse al final de los numerosos túneles.\
\
Tralli Buscagemas te ha pedido que encuentres y derrotes al troll y al trasgo, Horm y Rakothúrz, en la sala del trono del Gran Trasgo.","Tralli Buscagemas está en el campamento de Glóin, en las Montañas Nubladas, justo fuera de la entrada a la Ciudad de los Trasgos.\
\
Deberías volver con Tralli Buscagemas y contarle tu éxito.","'¡Bien hecho! Una victoria contra enemigos tan terribles es, sin duda, un logro digno.\
\
'Tienes nuestro agradecimiento, y debes saber que seguramente has salvado la vida de muchos que habrían sufrido destinos atroces a manos de esos adversarios.'","Habla con Tralli Buscagemas","'Todo lo que has descubierto contribuirá a que mantengamos más seguras las Montañas Nubladas en el futuro. Si fuésemos más numerosos ahora, no tengo duda de que Glóin volvería él mismo a adentrarse en las profundidades de la Ciudad de los Trasgos para destruir a los trasgos que allí moran. Pero, por desgracia, somos pocos, y hay amenazas mayores que contener en otros lugares. Seamos entonces directos...\
\
'Glóin desea que prestes atención al trasgo y al troll, Rakothúrz y Horm, dentro de la sala del trono del Gran Trasgo. El señor Elrond mencionó que las fuerzas de Angmar quieren atraerlos al conflicto en el norte y el oeste, y si logramos destruirlos podríamos salvar la vida de innumerables aliados.\
\
'Busca en la sala del trono de la Ciudad de los Trasgos a ese troll y ese trasgo, y cuando hayan sido derrotados, regresa conmigo. La Ciudad de los Trasgos se halla al noreste.'","Rakothúrz y Horm","'Busca a Rakothúrz y Horm en la sala del trono de la Ciudad de los Trasgos.'","La información obtenida de las cartas que recuperaste en Lengua Negra llevó a Glóin a ofrecer recompensas por derrotar a Rakothúrz y Horm, un domador de trasgos y un terrible troll de las cavernas que se encuentran en la sala del trono del Gran Trasgo, en la Ciudad de los Trasgos.","'Gracias a tus esfuerzos, Rakothúrz y Horm ya no harán daño a los Pueblos Libres.'"},
[10069]={"Rally the Warriors","Ghai-buri-Sêk will lead his warriors against the Uruk-hai of Kala-gijak. He has asked for your help in gathering them.","Gathered Drúedain villagers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Our warriors ready for battle. We seek the blood of our enemies. Do not fail our people.'","Gather Drúedain villagers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Ghai-buri-Sêk","Ghai-buri-Sêk can be found in the village Bhol Rûdh.\
\
You should talk to Ghai-buri-Sêk.","Drúedain villagers can be found in Bhol Rûdh.\
\
You should gather Drúedain villagers.","'${PLAYER}, I will lead our warriors to Kala-gijak, but first they meet the outsider. Walk the village and show who fights beside us.'"},
[10070]={"'Bien hecho, ${PLAYER}. Eres una inspiración para los pueblos de la Tierra Media.\
\
'Veamos ahora tu siguiente tarea.'","Ánimo de Eldur levantado","Lythur se pone firme al verte acercar. Te cuenta sus recientes encuentros en Moria y le ofreces palabras de ánimo.\
\
Al escucharte, parece tranquilizarse y se relaja visiblemente.","Levanta el ánimo de Eldur","Skafti fija sus ojos en los tuyos y una expresión de reconocimiento cruza su rostro.\
\
'He oído hablar de ti, ${PLAYER}. Tus hazañas han llegado incluso a los oídos de los enanos bajo la montaña. No necesitas decir una sola palabra más. Sé por qué has venido; y digo que la verdadera medida de un capitán está en su mera presencia, como acabas de mostrarme.\
\
'Con permiso, Khazad-dûm aún no está bajo el dominio de sus legítimos señores. Tengo mucho trabajo por hacer y no habrá descanso hasta que este gran Pueblo de Durin recupere lo que le pertenece.'","Levanta el ánimo de Skafti","Muchos Barbiluengos que luchan por recuperar Moria se han visto desalentados por la tarea aparentemente imposible que tienen ante sí.","Garnyd se encuentra en Anazârmekhem, en las Profundidades Llameantes.\
\
Ahora que has levantado el ánimo de los enanos, es momento de regresar junto a Garnyd.","Ánimo de Lythur levantado","Levanta el ánimo de Lythur","Habla con Garnyd en Anazârmekhem","Eldur puede encontrarse en la Bodega Putrefacta, justo al oeste de las Profundidades Llameantes. Lythur está en el Umbral de Durin, en el borde occidental de la Gran Excavación, al norte de las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata. Skafti está en Jazârgund, en medio del Camino de Durin, en las zonas septentrionales de Moria.\
\
Garnyd te ha pedido que levantes el ánimo de tres soldados enanos dispersos por Moria: Eldur, Lythur y Skafti.","'Hemos visto que tus acciones sin duda inspiran a quienes te rodean, pero con demasiada frecuencia son las palabras de un capitán las que infunden valor en los corazones de la gente. Se dice que las palabras de los grandes capitanes a lo largo de las edades han cambiado el curso de batallas que de otro modo se habrían perdido. Sin el poder del discurso, un capitán no es más que un guerrero común.\
\
'Para tu segunda tarea, quiero que hables con tres enanos. El primero, Eldur, se encuentra en la Bodega Putrefacta, que queda al oeste de aquí. El segundo, Lythur, está acampado en el Umbral de Durin, en el extremo occidental de la Gran Excavación, al noroeste. El tercero, Skafti, se halla en Jazârgund, en medio del Camino de Durin hacia el norte.\
\
'Usa tus palabras para levantar el ánimo de estos enanos, pues han visto demasiada desesperanza y ahora están llenos de tristeza.'","Grito de arenga","Los ojos de Eldur se iluminan tenuemente al verte acercarte. Escuchas el relato de su derrota reciente y le recuerdas que la muerte no es más que otro paso en el viaje de uno a través de las eras.\
\
Al oír esto, su ánimo mejora y asiente lentamente.\
\
'Gracias, capitán. Me has devuelto la fortaleza del corazón que me había sido arrebatada hace apenas unos días.'","Ánimo de Skafti levantado"},
[10071]={"Rallying a Defence","Repaired damaged barricades (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Garvir can be found in Linhir in eastern Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
You have readied the defences of Linhir and rallied the frightened Men who abandoned their posts. You should now speak to Garvir.","Warriors of Linhir can be found outside Linhir in eastern Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
Garvir has asked you to rally warriors that fled when Aragorn and the Grey Host passed through Linhir.","Rally warriors who fled Linhir (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","DNT -- will not be seen","Rallied warriors who fled Linhir (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'I thank you for your aid, ${PLAYER}. Fearful as we all were at the sight of the Dead, I do not think it long before the Corsairs and Haradrim return to our gates once more.\
\
'Now that our defences are prepared and the men again hold their posts, I believe us ready for the coming battle.'","'Allow me a moment to turn my mind from my brothers, ${PLAYER}. The recent battle in Linhir was brought to an abrupt end by the arrival of Aragorn and the Grey Host. Corsairs, Haradrim, and my fellow Gondorians alike threw down their arms and fled at the sight of them. I saw only Angbor standing amidst the tumult, but now he too has gone from these lands....\
\
'It was a battle half-fought, and one that is bound to be finished. Our barricades are in ruin and many of our men are scattered still. If you would aid us in restoring our defences, I would be most grateful.\
\
'Let us hope the Grey Host has left us for good... I doubt any of us could bear such terror a second time.'","Barricades can be found along the borders of Linhir in eastern Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
Garvir has asked you to aid in repairing the defences of Linhir before the Corsairs and Haradrim can rally against the settlement once more.","Repair damaged barricades (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","In the wake of Aragorn and the Grey Host's passing, Garvir struggles to once again ready the defences of Linhir for battle.","Talk to Garvir"},
[10072]={"Wuscrad spoke of abandoned homes just north of the town of Elthengels, beyond the gates of town.\
\
The Elthengels garrison commander has asked you to secure provisions from the nearby recently abandoned homes.","Potential recruits can be found within the walls of the town of Elthengels.\
\
Wuscrad has asked you to speak with refugees to Elthengels and to convince them to volunteer to join the militia.","Wuscrad can be found in the town of Elthengels.\
\
Wuscrad awaits news of the potential recruits for the Elthengels militia.","'You have found candidates worthy of training? This is excellent news, but we must act quickly. A true militia needs more than just able bodies, it needs weapons, training equipment, food, and other provisions.'\
\
'I will provide the equipment and the training. Would you be willing to find some rations to keep us supplied for a while longer? There are some recently abandoned homes north of town...check there for any provisions worth securing.'","Collect spare provisions at the abandoned homes north of Elthengels (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Never did I wish to become a soldier and march off towards war, but it would appear that a war for us is inevitable. Once again, the Orcs will be crashing at our door, and we will be forced to defend ourselves, ready or not.\
\
'When that day comes, I would prefer to stand bravely with a weapon raised against my foes, and I will encourage others to do the same. The militia may consider me grateful for their training.'","Convince Elthengels refugees to volunteer for the militia (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'You would dare me to stand before an entire army of Orcs when I was unable to save my own home from a few pitiful savages and thieves? I am but a farmer...neither sword nor spear have I carried, but I am no coward.\
\
'Honour bids that I must fight to repay my benefactors. The people of Elthengels have welcomed me and sheltered me, and in this way, I will repay my debt to them. Tell the militia to expect my company. If I am to fight, there is much that I must learn.'","Rallying a Militia","'Greetings to you, good ${RACE}. Grim is the fate of this land, but we will not simply lay down to die. If Théoden King will not send us aid, then we shall find the strength within our own people.\
\
'Many of those now here in Elthengels have fled their homes seeking refuge behind our walls. Yet it is these same men that must now stand and face the dangers looming ever greater.\
\
'I am eager to provide these refugees with weapons and training, they need only show the desire to fight. Yet few have stepped forward, and my hope of forming a militia among them quickly fades. Perhaps they could be convinced by an outsider, such as yourself. Will you aid me in finding recruits?'","Collected provisions for the militia (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Wuscrad, the garrison commander, has asked you to help raise a militia from the refugees and locals of Elthengels.","Convinced Elthengels refugees to volunteer for the militia (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Return to Wuscrad with news of the new recruits","Return to Wuscrad with the provisions","'I have lost my home and my land. My family is all that matters to me now. Each day here, I have worked various odd jobs just to earn enough coin to keep my children sheltered and fed.\
\
'Time is scarce for training and the like. Yet, I believe if this militia were to provide my family with an allotment of food each day, then I might use the time given to learn the skills to protect them. You tell this garrison commander that I accept his offer, so long as my children remain eating.'","'These provisions will help keep food and supplies available for the newly enlisted, and their families, for some time. We may yet see the people of Norcrofts defend Elthengels in the place of Théoden's Riders.\
\
'Thank you, ${PLAYER}. I am in your debt.'","Wuscrad can be found in the town of Elthengels.\
\
You should return the recovered provisions to Wuscrad in the town of Elthengels."},
[10073]={"Pick up the translated journal","'Aye, I finished my translation. I am none too happy about what I found in these pages. Unholy and fell dealings with evil creatures, muck monsters, dragons, and abominations of nature.\
\
'The journal and its translation are on the table. You tell Mother Amma to be careful. This madman is not acting alone.'","Málur Keenword has finished his translation of the madman's journal.","Bring the journal to Mother Amma","Talk to Málur Keenword","Mother Amma is in Bazanmanar.\
\
You should bring the translated journal to Mother Amma.","'What news do you bring? Málur has completed the translation? Well, let us have a look.'","'The sarrowstone crystal you collected from the Wargs is akin to the ones we saw in Elderslade, but there is something else going on here. The colour is new and it... feels different. Blah, the stench remains just as vile, however. Now then, where is the madman’s journal?'\
\
You tell her that Málur Keenword is working on it.\
\
'Well, go over and see what he has discovered.'","Ramblings Decoded","Málur is located in Bazanmanar.\
\
Mother Amma has asked you to see how far Málur Keenword has come in deciphering the journal.","The journal is on the table beside Málur in Clovengap.\
\
You should pick up the translated journal."},
[10074]={"Malthenor de Rivendel se ha instalado en las Montañas Nubladas para montar guardia en el campamento de Glóin.\
\
Malthenor está complacido de oír que has derrotado a muchas bestias de las nieves.","Las bestias de las nieves se encuentran por todas las Montañas Nubladas y son un peligro para cualquier viajero que las atraviese.","Derrota bestias de las nieves","Bestias desbocadas","Bestias de las nieves derrotadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","''¡Has sobrevivido a las garras de las bestias de las nieves y has vuelto para contarlo, ${PLAYER}! Me alegra oírlo, y decirte que has prestado un gran servicio a quienes se ven obligados a viajar por las montañas.'","Las bestias de las nieves se encuentran en las Montañas Nubladas, especialmente cerca del nacimiento del Bruinen.\
\
Derrota bestias de las nieves donde quiera que las encuentres para hacer los pasos de montaña más seguros para los viajeros.","'Las bestias de las nieves son feroces criaturas que luchan con garras y fauces en las altas crestas, ${PLAYER}, y son un grave peligro para quienes se ven obligados a viajar por las montaña. Deben ser derrotadas donde quiera que se encuentren.'","Derrota bestias de las nieves (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[10075]={"'I did not see them coming. Thank you for dispatching them. I am not certain I can stand just yet. Will more of them come to harass me?\
\
'My leg is hurt badly, and I think I could use a splint and some bandages. Could you please see if the healer in the shop nearby has any supplies to spare?'","You bandaged Broda's wounds","'The man who works the horses in the field behind this stable looked like he was being followed by a group of men. They were from the lower part of the city, which means they are likely up to no good. \
\
'I have been instructed by the captain to leave them alone, but I fear for the stable-hand. Please, go around the corner and see if he is all right?'","Talk to Broda","Bandage Broda's wounds","Talk to the healer in Woodhurst","Broda is in the field behind the stable.\
\
You should speak with Broda again, before moving on.","Tensions in the city are rising. Those with Dunlending blood feel that great injustices have been committed against their kind and harbor ill will towards anyone with obvious Rohirrim heritage.","'Oh, how awful...that poor man! Aye, I have some supplies in a spare pack, which I save for emergencies. I have extra, so I can part with it without much concern. Please take it and use whatever you need to help him.'","Broda, the injured stable-hand, is in the field behind the stable by the eastern gate of Woodhurst.\
\
You should bring the healer's pack to Broda at once.","Rampant Anger","'Thank you, ${PLAYER}. I must be more aware. The ruffians seemed to come out of nowhere! Will their friends come to finish what they began? \
\
'You will not always be around to protect me, and it seems that I cannot rely upon the guards. Some of the others have been leaving town, and I may have to follow if I wish to stay alive.'","Look for the stable-hand","The healer gives you her pack of supplies","The healer is in the shop behind the inn that faces the fountain in the centre of Woodhurst.\
\
Broda asked you to seek help for him from the town healer.","The stable-hand is in the field behind the stable.\
\
A guard saw a local stable-hand being followed by a rowdy group of men and has asked you to check on him."},
[10076]={"Un grupo de saqueadores de tumbas tuvo un encontronazo con los osos de Nan Orngon, al este de Ost Forod en Tyrn Fornech.\
\
Robin Sotopardo te ha pedido que encuentres los cuerpos de los saqueadores de tumbas de Nan Orngon y recuperes cualquier artefacto que pudieran haber robado.","Un encontronazo con los osos","Robin Sotopardo ha compartido contigo su alegría por la mala suerte de una banda de saqueadores de tumbas, y quiere que recuperes cualquier artefacto que estuvieran transportando.","'Deberíamos intentar reunir el resto de la estatua rota, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo mío[m]|amiga mía[f]}!'","'Mientras no estabas, escuché que un grupo de saqueadores transportaba reliquias de las islas tuvo un encontronazo con los osos de Tyrn Fornech. ¿No es maravilloso?\
\
'Aparentemente, esperaban mantenerse a una buena distancia de Tinnudir y habían dado un gran rodeo por el este, pero se alejaron demasiado y se toparon con los osos de Nan Orngon. Qué suerte: ¡mala para ellos pero buena para nosotros, ${PLAYER}!\
\
'Ve en dirección este de Ost Forod a Nan Orngon y busca en los cuerpos las reliquias que los saqueadores traían con ellos. ¡Los osos no tienen interés por ellas, así que supongo que no le simportará que las devolvamos a los montaraces! Ten cuidado mientras estés en Nan Orngon... ¡los osos no discriminan entre los amigos de los Dúnedain y los malvados saqueadores de tumbas!'","Recupera la reliquia robada del cuerpo de un saqueador de tumbas","'¿No has encontrado nada en los cuerpos de los saqueadores en Nan Orngon, ${PLAYER}?'","'Esta estatua es muy interesante y muy antigua, ${PLAYER}. Me pregunto cuántos fragmentos de esta estatua ya han sido reclamados por los saqueadores.\
\
'Si podemos reconstruir la estatua completa, ¡sé que Calenglad y los otros montaraces estarían muy complacidos!'","'Aun hecha pedazos, la estatua que has recuperado tiene un porte noble.'","Robin Sotopardo está en Ost Forod, al oeste de Nan Orngon, en Tyrn Fornech.\
\
Has recuperado un fragmento de estatua antigua de un saqueador que tuvo algunos problemas con los osos de Nan Orngon. Robin Sotopardo te ha pedido que vuelvas con cualquier reliquia que encuentres a Ost Forod.","Lleva la estatuilla rota a Robin Sotopardo","'Unos saqueadores de tumbas tuvieron un encontronazo con los osos de Nan Orngon, al este. ¿No es maravilloso?\
\
'Ve a Nan Orngon y recupera cualquier artefacto que pudieran estar transportando. Los osos no los necesitan, después de todo, y así podremos devolverlos a su lugar.'"},
[10077]={"No seas derrotado","Your patrol is complete","'Trolls have been called from the north. We must redouble our efforts, else the Free Peoples here will fall, and Angmar will flood Eriador through the Trollshaws. Steel your nerve, brother, and know that the hero who stands at your post will not fail us.'","Patrol the Ettenmoors for 60 minutes","Patrol the Ettenmoors.","Has sido ${PLAYERNAME:derrotado[m]|derrotada[f]}","Ranger in the Ettenmoors","Patrol the Ettenmoors in search of the Enemy. You must patrol for 60 minutes. After 60 minutes you will be returned to your post."},
[10078]={"Patrol the Ettenmoors","No seas derrotado","Your patrol is complete","'Trolls have been called from the north. We must redouble our efforts, else the Free Peoples here will fall, and Angmar will flood Eriador through the Trollshaws. Steel your nerve, brother, and know that the hero who stands at your post will not fail us.'","Patrol the Ettenmoors.","Has sido ${PLAYERNAME:derrotado[m]|derrotada[f]}","Ranger in the Ettenmoors","Patrol the Ettenmoors in search of the Enemy. You must patrol for 60 minutes. After 60 minutes you will be returned to your post."},
[10079]={"Patrol the Ettenmoors","No seas derrotado","Your patrol is complete","'Trolls have been called from the north. We must redouble our efforts, else the Free Peoples here will fall, and Angmar will flood Eriador through the Trollshaws. Steel your nerve, brother, and know that the hero who stands at your post will not fail us.'","Patrol the Ettenmoors.","Has sido ${PLAYERNAME:derrotado[m]|derrotada[f]}","Ranger in the Ettenmoors","Patrol the Ettenmoors in search of the Enemy. You must patrol for 60 minutes. After 60 minutes you will be returned to your post."},
[10080]={"Patrol the Ettenmoors","Your patrol is complete","'Trolls have been called from the north. We must redouble our efforts else the Free Peoples here will fall and Angmar will flood Eriador through the Trollshaws. Steel your nerve, brother, and know that the hero who stands at your post will not fail us.'","Patrol the Ettenmoors.","Debes ser ${PLAYERNAME:derrotado[m]|derrotada[f]} menos de tres veces (/)","Has sido ${PLAYERNAME:derrotado[m]|derrotada[f]}","Ranger in the Ettenmoors","Patrol the Ettenmoors in search of the Enemy. You must patrol for 60 minutes. After 60 minutes you will be returned to your post."},
[10083]={"'Ah, then you are prepared to take on the role of noble Man. Very well.'","'Congratulations, you are victorious!'","Ranger vs. Troll","Habla con el montaraz para completar la misión.","You have achieved a goal open to only a few. You will have the glory of representing the Free People as a ranger from Esteldín against a troll out of Angmar.","Speak with the ranger to enter mortal battle as a ranger","'Welcome warrior. This is your opportunity to prove your prowess on the field of battle. If you choose to, you may speak with me again to enter mortal battle with an opponent of great power and strength.\
\
'You will take on the role of a ranger of Esteldín a noble Man who fights to defend and keep safe the sanctity of Middle-earth. Your opponent will be a terrible troll out of Angmar.\
\
'Speak with me again to launch your ranger session.'","Speak again to the ranger within this room and choose to enter battle as a noble ranger out of Esteldín."},
[10084]={"'Ha! Ha! I am sorry your friend Radanir is unhappy. Mucking out the oxen is not a pleasant task, but if it is not done, all suffer. There are very few desirable tasks when it comes to preparing for war, ${PLAYER}, but all must be done.'\
\
Penrod laughs heartily.\
\
'But I am not ankle-deep in manure, am I? Perhaps I will find someone to take Radanir's place. We are grateful for the help and do not want any of the Rangers to resent volunteering it!\
\
'Thank you for your help and theirs, ${PLAYER}. The clans arrayed against us are fierce and merciless, but they do not have allies from the North, as we do!'","Rangers Put to Work","'We are doing all we can, ${PLAYER}. I have been assisting Rhus with the tanning; it is dirty, odious work, but the Falcon-clan needs the leather if they are to have fresh armour for its warriors.\
\
'I saw Radanir not long ago. He was not very happy about something, but would not tell me what it was. Right now I am working to clear this brush so we can stretch some more hides as they come in.'","Talk to Braigiar in Tûr Morva","Talk to Penrod in Tûr Morva","Talk to Radanir in Tûr Morva","Halbarad, Radanir, and Braigiar can be found throughout Tûr Morva.\
\
Penrod wants you to check on with members of the Grey Company helping the Falcon-clan prepare for war with Saruman.","Talk to Halbarad in Tûr Morva","'There is a great deal to do before the Falcon-clan is ready, but this work will be worth it in the end. We have few enough allies in this land. If the sweat of our brow can help the Hebog-lûth stand against the clans loyal to Saruman, the work is worth it.\
\
'We have already brought much in the way of food. Once it is dried or preserved, it will be wrapped and ready. My arms ache, but not so badly that I must stop.'","'I know allies among the Dunlendings are precious few, ${PLAYER}, but I do not see what is so different about the Falcon-clan than others that we have seen.\
\
'They have me mucking out the oxen! I have seen more manure already in Dunland than I have in my entire life back north. I could be doing something useful, but instead they hand me a hay-fork and a broom and tell me to get to work.\
\
'I do not like these men, ${PLAYER}, and it is not because of the manure. There are plenty of reasons, but the smell of manure has made me forget most of them. I say we bid them farewell and leave them to their own devices!'","'Your Ranger friends are helping us prepare for war. You should check with them and see how they are doing.'","Penrod wants you to check in on some of the Rangers who are helping the Falcon-clan prepare for war and see how they are doing.","'Your Ranger friends have already been very helpful, ${PLAYER}. If the clans loyal to Saruman try to strike us before we are ready to leave, we may yet have a chance.\
\
'Speak with your friends and see how they progress with their tasks.'","Penrod is among the northern buildings of Tûr Morva.\
\
You have spoken with a number of Rangers and found how they are helping with the preparations."},
[10085]={",\
\
Ahora ya eres bien ${PLAYERNAME:conocido[m]|conocida[f]} entre nosotros, y me gustaría invitarte a contemplar Annúminas y las ruinas de nuestro antiguo reino. Estamos acampados en las ruinas de Tinnudir, a orillas del Lago Evendim.\
\
Visítanos, si así lo deseas.\
\
Calenglad","'${PLAYERNAME:Bienvenido, amigo.[m]|Bienvenida, amiga.[f]}\
\
'Como puedes ver, estamos aquí con la intención de recuperar parte de nuestro legado. Imagina nuestra sorpresa al descubrir las ruinas plagadas de esbirros del Enemigo.\
\
'Si te interesa, podríamos usar tu ayuda.'","Montaraces en Evendim","Tinnudir se encuentra en la ribera oriental del Lago Evendim, un enorme lago bajo la sombra de las Montañas Azules. Calenglad debe de estar apostado en algún lugar del campamento allí.\
\
Calenglad te envió un mensaje invitándote a hablar con él en Tinnudir.","Te ha llegado una carta del líder de una expedición de Montaraces en Evendim. La carta te invitaba a visitarlos en las ruinas de Tinnudir.","Habla con Calenglad en Tinnudir"},
[10086]={"Se busca: arcos cortos rotos de los orcos, angmarim y malvados Hijos de la Tierra al sur y al este de Esteldín. Entregue los artículos a Ferrif dentro de Esteldín.","Se busca: arcos cortos rotos de los orcos, angmarim y malvados Hijos de la Tierra al sur y al este de Esteldín.","'Podemos convertir estos arcos en algo que nos ayude en esta lucha. Gracias.'","Arcos cortos rotos recolectados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger arcos cortos rotos de los orcos, angmarim e Hijos de la Tierra en el área que rodea Esteldín por el sur y el este. Una vez recogidos, debes entregar los artículos a Ferrif dentro de Esteldín.","Entregar los arcos cortos rotos a Ferrif en Esteldín","'Reúne las armas de los enemigos del este y del sur y tráenoslas.'","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Tarea de los Montaraces de Esteldín: Arcos cortos rotos","Ferrif, un Montaraz, ha pedido que se le entregue una colección de arcos cortos rotos en la casa del Montaraz en Esteldín.","Recolectar arcos cortos rotos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[10087]={"Se busca: Lanzas de madera rotas de los orcos y sombras al norte de Amon Raith.","Has aceptado la tarea de entregar lanzas de madera rotas a Nathan Hodges en Amon Raith, en las Quebradas del Norte. Puedes encontrar lanzas de madera rotas de los orcos y sombras al norte de Amon Raith.","'Guillermo mencionó que hay orcos y sombras más fuertes al norte. ¿Nos ayudarás a conseguir sus armas rotas?'","Tarea de los Montaraces de Esteldín: Lanzas de madera rotas","Nathan Hodges, en Amon Raith, espera la recolección y entrega de lanzas de madera rotas.","Recolecta lanzas de madera rotas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: Lanzas de madera rotas de los orcos y sombras al norte de Amon Raith. Entregue los artículos a Nathan Hodges en Amon Raith.","Entregar las lanzas de madera rotas a Nathan Hodges en Amon Raith","Lanzas de madera rotas recolectadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Esto me calma un poco. Gracias.'"},
[10088]={"'Hay orcos por todas partes en las Quebradas del Norte. Un gran campamento al sur se está atrincherando, pero son los grupos de renegados del Poniente los que amenazan a la gente de allí. Rómpeles las armas y tráemelas aquí.'","Se busca: Lanzas de madera rotas de los orcos al Poniente de Esteldín.","Tarea de los Montaraces de Esteldín: Lanzas de madera rotas","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger lanzas de madera rotas de los orcos en el área que rodea Esteldín hacia el Poniente. Una vez recogidos, debes entregar los artículos a Ferrif dentro de Esteldín.","Ferrif, un Montaraz, ha pedido que se le entregue una colección de lanzas de madera rotas en la casa del Montaraz en Esteldín.","Se busca: Lanzas de madera rotas de los orcos al Poniente de Esteldín. Entregue los artículos a Ferrif dentro de Esteldín.","Lanzas de madera rotas recolectadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Entregar las lanzas de madera rotas a Ferrif en Esteldín","Recolecta lanzas de madera rotas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","'Buen trabajo, hay menos de ellos capaces de dañar a la gente de las Quebradas del Norte. Gracias.'"},
[10089]={"Se busca: Escamas rugosas de los sierpes y dragonzuelos al norte de Esteldín. Entregue los artículos a Ferrif dentro de Esteldín.","Tarea de los Montaraces de Esteldín: Escamas rugosas","Se busca: Escamas rugosas de los sierpes y dragonzuelos al norte de Esteldín.","'Las escamas se pueden cambiar a los Hijos de la Tierra por ayuda con las reparaciones. Si podemos reunir suficientes, podremos prepararnos mejor para las próximas batallas.'","Recoger escamas rugosas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Comenzaré a agruparlos ahora, gracias.'","Entregar las escamas rugosas a Ferrif en Esteldín","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger escamas rugosas de los sierpes y dragonzuelos en el área que rodea Esteldín por el norte. Una vez recogidos, debes entregar los artículos a Ferrif dentro de Esteldín.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Escamas rugosas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Ferrif, un Montaraz, ha pedido que se le entregue una colección de escamas rugosas en la casa del Montaraz en Esteldín."},
[10090]={"'Me aseguraré de que Agnes les dé un buen uso. Gracias.'","Entregar el pelaje áspero a Nathan Hodges en Amon Raith","Pelajes ásperos recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se busca: Pelajes ásperos de bestias al norte de Amon Raith.","Se busca: Pelajes ásperos de bestias al norte de Amon Raith. Entregue los artículos a Nathan Hodges en Amon Raith.","Recoger pelajes ásperos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Nathan Hodges, en Amon Raith, espera la recolección y entrega de pieles ásperas.","Has aceptado la tarea de entregar pieles ásperas a Nathan Hodges en Amon Raith, en las Quebradas del Norte. Puedes encontrar las pieles ásperas en las bestias al norte de la ruina de Amon Raith.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","'Agnes pidió estas pieles. Quiere que la piel provenga de osos, pero cualquier piel áspera se puede usar para crear mantas. Tendrás que ir al norte para encontrar bestias con pelaje áspero.'","Tarea de los Montaraces de Esteldín: Pelaje áspero"},
[10091]={"Se busca: Pelaje áspero de las bestias al Poniente de Esteldín.","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger pelaje áspero de las bestias en el área que rodea Esteldín hacia el Poniente. Una vez recogidos, debes entregar los artículos a Ferrif dentro de Esteldín.","Recoger pelaje áspero (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Entregar el pelaje áspero a Ferrif en Esteldín","Ferrif, un Montaraz, ha pedido que se le entregue una colección de pelaje áspero en la casa del Montaraz en Esteldín.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: Pelaje áspero de las bestias al Poniente de Esteldín. Entregue los artículos a Ferrif dentro de Esteldín.","'Estamos cortos de suministros para aquellos que más necesitan ayuda. Necesitamos cada pedacito de suministros que podamos reunir. Los pelajes de las bestias del Poniente serán un buen punto de partida.'","'Les daremos un buen uso. Gracias.'","Tarea de los Montaraces de Esteldín: Pelaje áspero"},
[10092]={"Has aceptado la tarea de recoger piel áspera de las bestias en el área que rodea Esteldín hacia el Poniente. Una vez recogidos, debes entregar los artículos a Frerrif dentro de Esteldín.","Se busca: Piel áspera de las bestias al Poniente de Esteldín.","Ferrif, un Montaraz, ha pedido que se le entregue una colección de piel áspera en la casa del Montaraz en Esteldín.","Recoger piel áspera (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Entregar la piel áspera a Ferrif en Esteldín","Tarea de los Montaraces de Esteldín: Piel áspera","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: Piel áspera de las bestias al Poniente de Esteldín. Entregue los artículos a Ferrif dentro de Esteldín.","'El cuero fino se puede usar para remendar ropa, zapatos o mochilas. La piel áspera se puede convertir en ese cuero.'","'Encontraremos un uso para estos artículos. Gracias.'"},
[10093]={"Recoger pieles ásperas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Necesitamos reparar muchos artículos, zapatos, correas y similares. Si puedes conseguir piel áspera de las bestias más duras al norte de Amon Raith, puedo arreglar mucho de lo que todavía tenemos.'","Se busca: Pieles ásperas de bestias al norte de Amon Raith. Entregue los artículos a Nathan Hodges en Amon Raith.","Tarea de los Montaraces de Esteldín: Pieles ásperas","Entregar las pieles ásperas a Nathan Hodges en Amon Raith","Pieles ásperas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Nathan Hodges, en Amon Raith, espera la recolección y entrega de pieles ásperas.","Se busca: Pieles ásperas de bestias al norte de Amon Raith.","Has aceptado la tarea de entregar pieles ásperas a Nathan Hodges en Amon Raith, en las Quebradas del Norte. Puedes encontrar las pieles ásperas de las bestias al norte de la ruina de Amon Raith.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","'Puedo hacer un buen uso de estos. Gracias.'"},
[10094]={"Entregar el polvo tenue a Nathan Hodges en Amon Raith","Se busca: Polvo tenue de las sombras del noroeste de Amon Raith. Entregue los artículos a Nathan Hodges en Amon Raith.","'Estoy seguro de que el elfo estará encantado con esta colección. Gracias.'","Tarea de los Montaraces de Esteldín: Polvo tenue","Polvo tenue recogido (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Nathan Hodges, en Amon Raith, espera la recolección y entrega de polvo tenue.","Se busca: Polvo tenue de las sombras del noroeste de Amon Raith.","'Ese Elfo, Londrandir, pidió dos cosas, polvo y esencia, ambas de las sombras del noroeste. Quién soy yo para discutir, sólo estoy organizando la colección.'","Has aceptado la tarea de entregar polvo tenue a Nathan Hodges en Amon Raith, en las Quebradas del Norte. Puedes encontrar polvo tenue en las sombras al noroeste de Amon Raith.","Recoger polvo tenue (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú."},
[10095]={"Se busca: Orejas defectuosas de las bestias al Poniente de Esteldín. Entregue los artículos a Ferrif dentro de Esteldín.","Entregar las orejas defectuosas a Ferrif en Esteldín","Ferrif, un Montaraz, ha pedido que se le entregue una colección de orejas defectuosas en la casa del Montaraz en Esteldín.","Recoger orejas defectuosas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Orejas defectuosas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Aunque son poco más que trofeos, necesitamos las orejas defectuosas de las bestias menores al Poniente de Esteldín.'","Tarea de los Montaraces de Esteldín: Orejas defectuosas","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger orejas defectuosas de las bestias en el área que rodea Esteldín hacia el Poniente. Una vez recogidos, debes entregar los artículos a Ferrif dentro de Esteldín.","'Puede parecer una petición extraña, pero tienen algún valor, gracias.'","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: Orejas defectuosas de las bestias al Poniente de Esteldín."},
[10096]={"Has aceptado la tarea de recoger masa defectuosa de las arañas en el área que rodea Esteldín hacia el Poniente. Una vez recogidos, debes entregar los artículos a Ferrif dentro de Esteldín.","Se busca: Masa defectuosa de las arañas al Poniente de Esteldín.","Entregar la masa defectuosa a Ferrif en Esteldín","Masa defectuosa recogida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Me aseguraré de que esto se use bien, gracias.'","'Puede parecer asqueroso, pero hay mucho que podemos hacer con la sustancia pegajosa que proviene de las arañas. ¿Recoges un poco para nosotros?'","Ferrif, un Montaraz, ha pedido que se le entregue una colección de masa defectuosa en la casa del Montaraz en Esteldín.","Recoger masa defectuosa (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Tarea de los Montaraces de Esteldín: Masa defectuosa","Se busca: Masa defectuosa de las arañas al Poniente de Esteldín. Entregue los artículos a Ferrif dentro de Esteldín."},
[10097]={"'Ese Elfo, Londrandir, pidió dos cosas, polvo y esencia, ambas de las sombras del noroeste. ¿Quién soy yo para discutir? Sólo estoy organizando la colección.'","Se busca: Esencia brillante de las sombras del noroeste de Amon Raith.","Esencia brillante recogida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recoger esencia brillante (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se busca: Esencia brillante de las sombras del noroeste de Amon Raith. Entregue los artículos a Nathan Hodges en Amon Raith.","Has aceptado la tarea de entregar esencia brillante a Nathan Hodges en Amon Raith, en las Quebradas del Norte. Puedes encontrar esencia brillante en las sombras al noroeste de Amon Raith.","Nathan Hodges, en Amon Raith, espera la recolección y entrega de la esencia brillante.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","'Estoy seguro de que el Elfo estará encantado con esta colección. Gracias.'","Tarea de los Montaraces de Esteldín: Esencia brillante","Entregar la esencia brillante a Nathan Hodges en Amon Raith"},
[10098]={"'El cuero trabajado nos es útil aquí. Si podemos conseguir algo en cualquier forma de los enemigos del este, estaremos mejor preparados para el futuro.'","Vainas de espada pesadas recolectadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tarea de los Montaraces de Esteldín: Vainas de espada pesadas","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger vainas de espada pesadas de los orcos, angmarim e Hijos de la Tierra en el área que rodea Esteldín por el este y el norte. Una vez recogidos, debes entregar los artículos a Ferrif dentro de Esteldín.","Se busca: Vainas de espada pesadas de los orcos, angmarim e Hijos de la Tierra al norte y al este de Esteldín. Entregue los artículos a Ferrif dentro de Esteldín.","Se busca: Vainas de espada pesadas de los orcos, angmarim e Hijos de la Tierra al norte y al este de Esteldín.","Ferrif, un Montaraz, ha pedido que se le entregue una colección de vainas de espada pesadas en la casa del Montaraz en Esteldín.","Entregar las vainas de espada pesadas a Ferrif en Esteldín","'Podemos hacer uso de estos, gracias.'","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Recolectar vainas de espada pesadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[10099]={"'Puede que no podamos recuperar sus granjas u hogares, pero esto puede animar a algunos de los granjeros. Gracias.'","Se busca: Picos irregulares de los pájaros cerca de Puente de Caballetes. Entregue los artículos al Guardia Otley en el pueblo de Puente de Caballetes.","Se busca: Picos irregulares de los pájaros cerca de Puente de Caballetes.","Tarea de los Montaraces de Esteldín: Picos irregulares","Picos irregulares recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'A veces la venganza triunfa. Ese es el caso de esta petición. Muchos de los granjeros informaron haber visto a los pájaros negros con alas sobrevolando sus granjas antes de los ataques y quieren una retribución.'","Entregar los picos irregulares al Guardia Otley en Puente de Caballetes","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se te ha encomendado la tarea de recoger los picos irregulares de los pájaros cerca de Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Puedes entregar los artículos al Guardia Otley en Puente de Caballetes.","El guardia Otley, en Puente de Caballetes, está esperando la entrega de picos irregulares en la ciudad devastada por la guerra de Puente de Caballetes.","Recoger picos irregulares (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[10100]={"Entregar los picos irregulares a Ferrif en Esteldín","Recoger picos irregulares (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tarea de los Montaraces de Esteldín: Picos irregulares","'Es una petición extraña, pero podemos usar los picos de los pájaros y nos gustaría que recogieran algunos.'","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger picos irregulares de los pájaros en el área que rodea Esteldín por el norte y el Poniente. Una vez recogidos, debes entregar los artículos a Ferrif dentro de Esteldín.","Picos irregulares recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se busca: Picos irregulares de los pájaros al norte y Poniente de Esteldín.","Se busca: Picos irregulares de los pájaros al norte y Poniente de Esteldín. Entregue los artículos a Ferrif dentro de Esteldín.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Ferrif, un Montaraz, ha pedido que se le entregue una colección de picos irregulares en la casa del Montaraz en Esteldín.","'Parece una buena colección, gracias.'"},
[10101]={"Se busca: Gran suciedad de las arañas al Poniente de Esteldín. Entregue los artículos a Ferrif dentro de Esteldín.","Recoger gran suciedad (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Hay una serie de arañas al Poniente de nuestro asentamiento que plagan a la gente de esta tierra. Reduzca su número y recoja la suciedad que las cubre. Hay uso para todo.'","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger la gran suciedad de las arañas en el área que rodea Esteldín hacia el Poniente. Una vez recogidos, debes entregar los artículos a Ferrif dentro de Esteldín.","Ferrif, un Montaraz, ha pedido que se le entregue una colección de gran suciedad en la casa del Montaraz en Esteldín.","Entregar la gran suciedad a Ferrif en Esteldín","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: Gran suciedad de las arañas al Poniente de Esteldín.","Tarea de los Montaraces de Esteldín: Gran suciedad","'Saber que el número de estas criaturas ha disminuido es un pensamiento bienvenido. Gracias.'"},
[10102]={"Se busca: Alas grandes de los pájaros al norte y Poniente de Esteldín.","Entregar las alas grandes a Ferrif en Esteldín","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger alas grandes de los pájaros en el área que rodea Esteldín por el norte y el Poniente. Una vez recogidos, debes entregar los artículos a Ferrif dentro de Esteldín.","Ferrif, un Montaraz, ha pedido que se le entregue una colección de alas grandes en la casa del Montaraz en Esteldín.","Recoger alas grandes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Las alas de los pájaros de la zona se pueden arrancar y usar para la ropa de cama.'","Se busca: Alas grandes de los pájaros al norte y Poniente de Esteldín. Entregue los artículos a Ferrif dentro de Esteldín.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Alas grandes recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tarea de los Montaraces de Esteldín: Alas grandes","'Nos pondremos a trabajar en esto, gracias.'"},
[10103]={"'El pelaje curtido se puede usar de muchas maneras. Si puedes encontrar algo de este pelaje, por favor tráenoslo aquí.'","Pelaje curtido recolectado (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recolectar pelaje curtido (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Ferrif, un Montaraz, ha pedido que se le entregue una colección de pelaje curtido en la casa del Montaraz en Esteldín.","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger pelaje curtido de las bestias en el área que rodea Esteldín por el norte y el este. Una vez recogidos, debes entregar los artículos a Ferrif dentro de Esteldín.","Se busca: Pelaje curtido de las bestias al norte y al este de Esteldín.","Entregar el pelaje curtido a Ferrif en Esteldín","Tarea de los Montaraces de Esteldín: Pelaje curtido","'Me aseguraré de que le demos un buen uso, gracias.'","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: Pelaje curtido de las bestias al norte y al este de Esteldín. Entregue los artículos a Ferrif dentro de Esteldín."},
[10104]={"Ferrif, un Montaraz, ha pedido que se le entregue una colección de plumas alborotadas en la casa del Montaraz en Esteldín.","Recoger plumas alborotadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se busca: Plumas alborotadas de los pájaros al norte y Poniente de Esteldín.","Se busca: Plumas alborotadas de los pájaros al norte y Poniente de Esteldín. Entregue los artículos a Ferrif dentro de Esteldín.","'Las plumas alborotadas se pueden usar para ajustar la ropa de cama. ¿Puedes ayudarnos?'","Plumas alborotadas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tarea de los Montaraces de Esteldín: Plumas alborotadas","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger plumas alborotadas de los pájaros en el área que rodea Esteldín por el norte y el Poniente. Una vez recogidos, debes entregar los artículos a Ferrif dentro de Esteldín.","Entregar las plumas alborotadas a Ferrif en Esteldín","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","'Nos pondremos a trabajar en esto, gracias.'"},
[10105]={"Ferrif, un Montaraz, ha pedido que se le entregue una colección de orejas con cicatrices en la casa del Montaraz en Esteldín.","Se busca: Orejas con cicatrices de las bestias al norte y al este de Esteldín. Entregue los artículos a Ferrif dentro de Esteldín.","Recoge orejas con cicatrices (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Aunque son poco más que trofeos, necesitamos las orejas con cicatrices de las bestias menores al este y al norte de Esteldín.'","'Puede parecer una petición extraña, pero tienen algún valor, gracias.'","Entregar las orejas con cicatrices a Ferrif en Esteldín","Tarea de los Montaraces de Esteldín: Orejas con cicatrices","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger orejas con cicatrices de las bestias en el área que rodea Esteldín por el norte y el este. Una vez recogidos, debes entregar los artículos a Ferrif dentro de Esteldín.","Se busca: Orejas con cicatrices de las bestias al norte y al este de Esteldín.","Orejas con cicatrices recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[10106]={"Recoger colas con cicatrices (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger colas con cicatrices de las bestias en el área que rodea Esteldín por el este y el sur. Una vez recogidos, debes entregar los artículos a Ferrif dentro de Esteldín.","Entregar las colas con cicatrices a Ferrif en Esteldín","Se busca: Colas con cicatrices de las bestias al sur y al este de Esteldín.","'Las colas de las bestias, dragonzuelos y sierpes se pueden usar como amarres. Consígueme algunos de estos, por favor.'","Tarea de los Montaraces de Esteldín: Colas con cicatrices","Se busca: Colas con cicatrices de las bestias al sur y al este de Esteldín. Entregue los artículos a Ferrif dentro de Esteldín.","Colas con cicatrices recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Podemos hacer uso de estos, gracias.'","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Ferrif, un Montaraz, ha pedido que se le entregue una colección de colas con cicatrices en la casa del Montaraz en Esteldín."},
[10107]={"'Haremos lo que podamos para mantener a todos con ropa y zapatos. Gracias.'","Se busca: Piel suave de las bestias al sur y al este de Esteldín.","Se busca: Piel suave de las bestias al sur y al este de Esteldín. Entregue los artículos a Ferrif dentro de Esteldín.","'La piel suave de las bestias se puede usar para botas y zapatos para aquellos que no buscan la Robustez que necesitan los tipos aventureros.'","Piel suave recolectada (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Ferrif, un Montaraz, ha pedido que se le entregue una colección de piel suave en la casa del Montaraz en Esteldín.","Entregar la piel suave a Ferrif en Esteldín","Tarea de los Montaraces de Esteldín: Piel suave","Recolectar piel suave (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger piel suave de las bestias en el área que rodea Esteldín por el este y el sur. Una vez recogidos, debes entregar los artículos a Ferrif dentro de Esteldín."},
[10108]={"Recoge suciedad pegajosa (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Al igual que la suciedad de las arañas del Poniente, esta sustancia tiene sus usos. Reúne un poco para mí, por favor.'","Tarea de los Montaraces de Esteldín: Suciedad pegajosa","Ferrif, un Montaraz, ha pedido que se le entregue una colección de suciedad pegajosa en la casa del Montaraz en Esteldín.","Suciedad pegajosa recogida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se busca: Suciedad pegajosa de las arañas al norte y al este de Esteldín. Entregue los artículos a Ferrif dentro de Esteldín.","Se busca: Suciedad pegajosa de las arañas al norte y al este de Esteldín.","'Esto se usará de una manera que ayude a nuestra gente, gracias.'","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger suciedad pegajosa de las arañas en el área que rodea Esteldín por el norte y el este. Una vez recogidos, debes entregar los artículos a Ferrif dentro de Esteldín.","Entregar la suciedad pegajosa a Ferrif en Esteldín"},
[10109]={"Tarea de los Montaraces de Esteldín: Caparazones resistentes","Se busca: Caparazones resistentes de las arañas al Poniente de Esteldín. Entregue los artículos a Ferrif dentro de Esteldín.","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger caparazones resistentes de las arañas en el área que rodea Esteldín hacia el Poniente. Una vez recogidos, debes entregar los artículos a Ferrif dentro de Esteldín.","Caparazones resistentes recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Podemos encontrar un uso para los caparazones endurecidos de las arañas al Poniente de Esteldín. Entrégamelos aquí.'","Ferrif, un Montaraz, ha pedido que se le entregue una colección de caparazones resistentes en la casa del Montaraz en Esteldín.","Se busca: Caparazones resistentes de las arañas al Poniente de Esteldín.","Recoger caparazones resistentes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Entregar los caparazones resistentes a Ferrif en Esteldín","'Encontraremos un uso para estos artículos. Gracias.'"},
[10110]={"Entregar las vainas de espada resistentes a Nathan Hodges en Amon Raith","Se busca: Vainas de espada resistentes de los orcos al norte de Amon Raith.","Nathan Hodges, en Amon Raith, espera la recolección y entrega de vainas de espada resistentes.","Se busca: Vainas de espada resistentes de los orcos al norte de Amon Raith. Entregue los artículos a Nathan Hodges en Amon Raith.","'Como si los trasgos no fueran suficientemente malos, ahora sabemos que hay orcos al norte. ¿Puedes traer pruebas de que estás reduciendo su número?'","Recolecta vainas de espada resistentes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","'Esto sin duda nos aliviará a todos de algunos de nuestros miedos. Gracias.'","Tarea de los Montaraces de Esteldín: Vainas de espada resistentes","Vainas de espada resistentes recolectadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has aceptado la tarea de entregar vainas de espada resistentes a Nathan Hodges en Amon Raith, en las Quebradas del Norte. Puedes encontrar vainas de espada resistentes en los orcos al norte de Amon Raith."},
